was causally useful because it exposed the missing architecture directory and was corrected, so it is not treated as unnecessary mutation.","evidence_ids":["cmd-4b86593d22214eaa","cmd-429d26d1416d43d8","cmd-0a096df292b141f8","cmd-8e06f09eeaaa4e16","cmd-b86472418fbc49c7","cmd-3020180ea8ad478b","cmd-83466e409be049c3","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets"]},"overall_summary":"Both material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol also showed a healthy pre-restart state, restart scheduling and connection loss, a changed boot identity, and recovery of the HTTP service, repository data, installed package, and configuration. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["OpenRC service failures were not covered by the systemd-oriented lifecycle failed-service probe; service health is instead established by direct OpenRC status and HTTP checks.","The retained configuration backup files were not included in a final filesystem inventory; their apparent retention is inferred from their creation and the absence of any cleanup command in the complete timeline."]}
